(6107718, 899726, 56545, '<td valign="top">Judging by the lights being on at the plant, and the ''light source'' doesn''t blow out all your details, I would guess this was taken at night... nice shot - some people may complain about the reflection being cropped, but I kinda like it that way.</td>', 'Judging by the lights being on at the plant, and the ''light source'' doesn''t blow out all your details, I would guess this was taken at night... nice shot - some people may complain about the reflection being cropped, but I kinda like it that way.', '2010-07-28 16:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
