(6108368, 900195, 56545, '<td valign="top">I like this image. The colours in the sky are fantastic (perhaps thanks to the industry) and complement the red ship well. Sharp, well framed, nice work... one of my favourites.</td>', 'I like this image. The colours in the sky are fantastic (perhaps thanks to the industry) and complement the red ship well. Sharp, well framed, nice work... one of my favourites.', '2010-07-29 09:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108371, 900178, 56545, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge... the textures on the glass fit perfectly and the glowing staircase is somehow enchanting... not sure how it will do overall but you''re in my top 10 images - good luck!</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge... the textures on the glass fit perfectly and the glowing staircase is somehow enchanting... not sure how it will do overall but you''re in my top 10 images - good luck!', '2010-07-29 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108373, 900154, 56545, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something the goes beyond the standard ''industrial'' scene to tell a bigger story - and the title works well, too.</td>', 'Nice to see something the goes beyond the standard ''industrial'' scene to tell a bigger story - and the title works well, too.', '2010-07-29 09:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108375, 899414, 56545, '<td valign="top">This looks like the entrance to some of the ''industrial'' clubs here in town :)</td>', 'This looks like the entrance to some of the ''industrial'' clubs here in town :)', '2010-07-29 09:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108379, 899167, 56545, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad that neither the fence in the foreground nor the building in the background is sharply in focus.</td>', 'It''s too bad that neither the fence in the foreground nor the building in the background is sharply in focus.', '2010-07-29 09:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108380, 900144, 56545, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast of textures here.</td>', 'I really like the contrast of textures here.', '2010-07-29 09:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108382, 899543, 56545, '<td valign="top">A really nice image - with the title as it is, I prefer it rotated 90 degrees counterclockwise, but that''s just being a little picky :)</td>', 'A really nice image - with the title as it is, I prefer it rotated 90 degrees counterclockwise, but that''s just being a little picky :)', '2010-07-29 09:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108384, 899775, 56545, '<td valign="top">Very crisp image, but the tilt I find a little un-settling.</td>', 'Very crisp image, but the tilt I find a little un-settling.', '2010-07-29 09:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108387, 898714, 56545, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a universe behind her - not sure it''s so believable for basic editing, but I''ll rate it assuming it is :)</td>', 'That''s quite a universe behind her - not sure it''s so believable for basic editing, but I''ll rate it assuming it is :)', '2010-07-29 09:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108406, 899172, 56545, '<td valign="top">I find it unbelieveable that people complain about how these look (and the windmills) spread out over a field, but there are no complaints about old smokestacks belching pollution into the air from coal and nuclear plants... anyways, great picture here, just perfect with the clouds reflecting in the dishes and only a hint of cloud in the sky behind them... I think this will ribbon for sure!</td>', 'I find it unbelieveable that people complain about how these look (and the windmills) spread out over a field, but there are no complaints about old smokestacks belching pollution into the air from coal and nuclear plants... anyways, great picture here, just perfect with the clouds reflecting in the dishes and only a hint of cloud in the sky behind them... I think this will ribbon for sure!', '2010-07-29 09:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108407, 900100, 56545, '<td valign="top">Bonus points for the title ;)</td>', 'Bonus points for the title ;)', '2010-07-29 09:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108408, 900156, 56545, '<td valign="top">Great twist on industrial - colours and the angle work perfectly.</td>', 'Great twist on industrial - colours and the angle work perfectly.', '2010-07-29 09:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108431, 899125, 116241, '<td valign="top">Great idea - but not enough focus on 1 spot.</td>', 'Great idea - but not enough focus on 1 spot.', '2010-07-29 10:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108500, 900093, 86218, '<td valign="top">Strong compo and colours works well with this long exposure. Top 5 in my voting. 8 You nailed this one</td>', 'Strong compo and colours works well with this long exposure. Top 5 in my voting. 8 You nailed this one', '2010-07-29 12:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108501, 899760, 86218, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Not sure what the rest of the voters would do but a 8 from me. This IS industrial</td>', 'I really like this. Not sure what the rest of the voters would do but a 8 from me. This IS industrial', '2010-07-29 12:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108502, 899775, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely clean image. Crisp but not sure about the angle on this. Only drawback from me 7</td>', 'Lovely clean image. Crisp but not sure about the angle on this. Only drawback from me 7', '2010-07-29 12:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108504, 900195, 86218, '<td valign="top">Something about this image appeals and certainly fits in the industrial frame. Love the colours in the water (and sky) but would love to have seen a longer exposure on this, had the ship not been moving that is 7</td>', 'Something about this image appeals and certainly fits in the industrial frame. Love the colours in the water (and sky) but would love to have seen a longer exposure on this, had the ship not been moving that is 7', '2010-07-29 12:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108505, 900096, 86218, '<td valign="top">Great shot. So simple but effective. What more can I say.</td>', 'Great shot. So simple but effective. What more can I say.', '2010-07-29 12:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108506, 899813, 86218, '<td valign="top">Industrial it is and the smoke/steam used with great effect with the two towers. Would maybe have liked to see more trail of the smoke but this is a portrait comp and as such works ok</td>', 'Industrial it is and the smoke/steam used with great effect with the two towers. Would maybe have liked to see more trail of the smoke but this is a portrait comp and as such works ok', '2010-07-29 12:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
