(6108621, 899313, 117314, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. But not really industrial. The corridor at my workplace looks like this! and I''m not working in an Industry.</td>', 'Nice shot. But not really industrial. The corridor at my workplace looks like this! and I''m not working in an Industry.', '2010-07-29 14:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6108650, 900156, 112828, '<td valign="top">While I am sure this is somehow related to the theme, I''m afraid it doesn''t exactly scream industrial at me..  Still a beautiful photo of excellent (and complementary indeed..) colors..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-05 18:32:45.</i></td>', 'While I am sure this is somehow related to the theme, I''m afraid it doesn''t exactly scream industrial at me..  Still a beautiful photo of excellent (and complementary indeed..) colors..', '2010-07-29 15:22:32.000000', '2010-08-05 19:32:45.000000', 1),
(6108654, 898822, 112828, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it, how is this industrial?  I mean sure, there''s in industry that manufactures boats, but...?  Storage industry? that''s a stretch for sure.<br/> <br/>Not a great photo either, certainly not a bad composition, but it could have been stronger if you were a bit more to the left.<br/> <br/>The processing is where this just falls flat.  Sorry, really I am, but this isn''t striking me as quality "Industrial" imagery.</td>', 'I don''t get it, how is this industrial?  I mean sure, there''s in industry that manufactures boats, but...?  Storage industry? that''s a stretch for sure. Not a great photo either, certainly not a bad composition, but it could have been stronger if you were a bit more to the left. The processing is where this just falls flat.  Sorry, really I am, but this isn''t striking me as quality "Industrial" imagery.', '2010-07-29 15:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
