(6111363, 900074, 47470, '<td valign="top">I find the white spot at the top too distracting.  I think a closer (but not too close--just enough to give a definite "subject") shot of the spray paint can or the electrical outlet would have helped focus the attention of the viewer.</td>', 'I find the white spot at the top too distracting.  I think a closer (but not too close--just enough to give a definite "subject") shot of the spray paint can or the electrical outlet would have helped focus the attention of the viewer.', '2010-08-01 09:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111365, 900030, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish the can of paint and the brush looked as weathered at the other elements.  The bright colors of the can look out of place.  That wall is amazing though; would be a wonderful background for a portrait.</td>', 'I wish the can of paint and the brush looked as weathered at the other elements.  The bright colors of the can look out of place.  That wall is amazing though; would be a wonderful background for a portrait.', '2010-08-01 09:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111368, 899335, 47470, '<td valign="top">Having something in focus on either side of the image with a lot of out-of-focus space in the middle makes my eyes jump back and forth across the image, which makes for a very tiring viewing experience.  The drawing is intriguing, so I would have preferred to have the left of the image cropped.</td>', 'Having something in focus on either side of the image with a lot of out-of-focus space in the middle makes my eyes jump back and forth across the image, which makes for a very tiring viewing experience.  The drawing is intriguing, so I would have preferred to have the left of the image cropped.', '2010-08-01 09:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111369, 900144, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the texture and the color of the metal, but I wish the lovely texture of the wood was also in focus.</td>', 'I love the texture and the color of the metal, but I wish the lovely texture of the wood was also in focus.', '2010-08-01 09:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111370, 900156, 118008, '<td valign="top">loves the colors, love the building, don''t know if i love the angle</td>', 'loves the colors, love the building, don''t know if i love the angle', '2010-08-01 09:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111379, 900100, 47470, '<td valign="top">I LOVE your title.  It''s witty and makes an even stronger connection with the challenge since legos are building blocks and building is, ya know, industrial.  Anyway, your title definitely makes your image much better.  I rarely give extra points for titles, but yours will definitely get a few : )  I really like the colors of your image, but I think I would crop some of the sky so the viewer won''t get lost in al that negative space.</td>', 'I LOVE your title.  It''s witty and makes an even stronger connection with the challenge since legos are building blocks and building is, ya know, industrial.  Anyway, your title definitely makes your image much better.  I rarely give extra points for titles, but yours will definitely get a few : )  I really like the colors of your image, but I think I would crop some of the sky so the viewer won''t get lost in al that negative space.', '2010-08-01 09:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111381, 899827, 47470, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail of the paint splatters, so I might have focused just on that, leaving out the newly painted part.  Adding a little more contrast would also emphasize the lovely tones in the rust.</td>', 'I really like the detail of the paint splatters, so I might have focused just on that, leaving out the newly painted part.  Adding a little more contrast would also emphasize the lovely tones in the rust.', '2010-08-01 09:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111382, 899127, 47470, '<td valign="top">Some sharpening and some contrast (bringing up the lighter parts, but leaving the darker parts) would make this pop.</td>', 'Some sharpening and some contrast (bringing up the lighter parts, but leaving the darker parts) would make this pop.', '2010-08-01 09:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111383, 900076, 47470, '<td valign="top">The composition lends itself to the long, unusual crop.  Nice usage of the vertical panoramic dimensions.</td>', 'The composition lends itself to the long, unusual crop.  Nice usage of the vertical panoramic dimensions.', '2010-08-01 09:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111384, 900060, 47470, '<td valign="top">The light and the colors of the buildings are pretty, but I''m on the fence about the inclusion of the fence in the foreground.</td>', 'The light and the colors of the buildings are pretty, but I''m on the fence about the inclusion of the fence in the foreground.', '2010-08-01 10:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111387, 900126, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the soft gradient of the sky, but I wish the light was coming from a slightly lower angle.</td>', 'I love the soft gradient of the sky, but I wish the light was coming from a slightly lower angle.', '2010-08-01 10:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111389, 899760, 47470, '<td valign="top">Beautiful yet disgusting at the same time : )</td>', 'Beautiful yet disgusting at the same time : )', '2010-08-01 10:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111414, 899740, 47470, '<td valign="top">Lovely black and white and great shadows!  I wish you had done a little more sharpening during post-processing.</td>', 'Lovely black and white and great shadows!  I wish you had done a little more sharpening during post-processing.', '2010-08-01 10:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111420, 900011, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish there was some background to add some context to the shot.</td>', 'I wish there was some background to add some context to the shot.', '2010-08-01 10:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111435, 899592, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the color cast and the detail in the wood.  I would love to see a little bit brighter whites though.  Lovely image nonetheless.</td>', 'I love the color cast and the detail in the wood.  I would love to see a little bit brighter whites though.  Lovely image nonetheless.', '2010-08-01 10:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
