(6111455, 900156, 47470, '<td valign="top">Perfect contrast and detail.  The diagonals help add some dynamic movement to the image too.  I can''t find anything I''d change.</td>', 'Perfect contrast and detail.  The diagonals help add some dynamic movement to the image too.  I can''t find anything I''d change.', '2010-08-01 10:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
