(6116956, 900108, 112107, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Hate the title and the tilt... need more tilt or to be straith up (in my opinion).  But... I love the image composition.  (voting later) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Tilt? What tilt? I think what 90% of what you''re seeing is perspective convergence!<br/> <br/>I like the dynamic in this photo, I just wish the colors were less muted, but I know this site and this is a tricky shot due to the massive amount of DR needed to capture it.<br/>Good work!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-04 06:08:41.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Hate the title and the tilt... need more tilt or to be straith up (in my opinion).  But... I love the image composition.  (voting later)  Tilt? What tilt? I think what 90% of what you''re seeing is perspective convergence! I like the dynamic in this photo, I just wish the colors were less muted, but I know this site and this is a tricky shot due to the massive amount of DR needed to capture it.Good work!', '2010-08-04 07:04:52.000000', '2010-08-04 07:08:41.000000', 0),
