(6117143, 900122, 23430, '<td valign="top">Congrats Rozzy. It looks nice. The high contrast B &amp; W plus the reflection all works. Well done mate.</td>', 'Congrats Rozzy. It looks nice. The high contrast B & W plus the reflection all works. Well done mate.', '2010-08-04 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6117167, 900122, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great reflections Roz. Congrats!</td>', 'Great reflections Roz. Congrats!', '2010-08-04 09:41:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6117171, 899172, 81530, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your new PB Leo.</td>', 'Congrats on your new PB Leo.', '2010-08-04 09:42:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6117175, 899726, 81530, '<td valign="top">Well done. Congrats!</td>', 'Well done. Congrats!', '2010-08-04 09:43:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6117286, 900122, 75034, '<td valign="top">Congratulations to you Roz on this fantastic shot, I love the mood and the texture of the shot. The reflections are a great touch and it''s nice that it wasn''t windy for you on the day you shot this.<br/> <br/>Famous on DPC (and other places I''m sure) for your macro shots for bugs and all things crawly it''s nice that you ribbon with other photography as well (although I''d wager there is a bug or two in this shot if we could look closer :) you are so talented and I would like to thank you for your wonderful photographic contributions to DPC and your help over the years I''ve been here. <br/> <br/>YOU ROCK ROZ!!!!!!<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Congratulations to you Roz on this fantastic shot, I love the mood and the texture of the shot. The reflections are a great touch and it''s nice that it wasn''t windy for you on the day you shot this. Famous on DPC (and other places I''m sure) for your macro shots for bugs and all things crawly it''s nice that you ribbon with other photography as well (although I''d wager there is a bug or two in this shot if we could look closer :) you are so talented and I would like to thank you for your wonderful photographic contributions to DPC and your help over the years I''ve been here.  YOU ROCK ROZ!!!!!! All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2010-08-04 10:38:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6117290, 900158, 110023, '<td valign="top">Your creativity is inspiring, and I have to say I love the fact your photographer''s comments begin with "put paper in front of cat...". :)))<br/> <br/>Awesome!</td>', 'Your creativity is inspiring, and I have to say I love the fact your photographer''s comments begin with "put paper in front of cat...". :))) Awesome!', '2010-08-04 10:38:55.000000', NULL, 0),
