(6117360, 900122, 44877, '<td valign="top">OMG ROZ! Congrats!! This is so amazing - the BW processing is through the roof. Reflections are always wildly popular and this one does not disappoint. Too awesome. OX</td>', 'OMG ROZ! Congrats!! This is so amazing - the BW processing is through the roof. Reflections are always wildly popular and this one does not disappoint. Too awesome. OX', '2010-08-04 11:02:44.000000', NULL, 0),
