(6120292, 899696, 79720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by zencow:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s a great picture... but, what do you mean by "Post processing includes cleaning up a little lens-flare"?   Is that allowed under the Basic Editing rules?  just curious.  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lens_flare" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lens-flare</a>, but I have a feeling you''re being sarcastic. I suppose, since it has not yet been validated by the SC, that it could still be DQ''ed. :(</td>', 'Originally posted by zencow: It''s a great picture... but, what do you mean by "Post processing includes cleaning up a little lens-flare"?   Is that allowed under the Basic Editing rules?  just curious.  :)  Lens-flare, but I have a feeling you''re being sarcastic. I suppose, since it has not yet been validated by the SC, that it could still be DQ''ed. :(', '2010-08-06 08:11:21.000000', NULL, 0),
